"请先处理对话框" = "Finish the Dialog First";
"“%@”当前有一个打开、保存或确认对话框正在等待处理。请先完成或取消该对话框，再关闭窗口；窗口布局管理不受影响。" = "“%@” has an open, save, or confirmation dialog waiting. Complete or cancel that dialog before closing the window. Layout management is not affected.";
"暂时无法关闭窗口" = "Can’t Close the Window Right Now";
"macOS 辅助功能服务暂时没有响应。RightScreen 已自动重试，请稍后再试。" = "The macOS Accessibility service isn’t responding. RightScreen already retried automatically. Please try again later.";
"需要辅助功能权限" = "Accessibility Permission Required";
"请在“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能”中允许 RightScreen，然后再次选择布局。" = "Allow RightScreen in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility, then choose a layout again.";
"这个窗口不提供关闭控制" = "This Window Has No Close Control";
"RightScreen 仍可管理它的位置和大小，但该窗口没有提供系统关闭按钮。为避免误关窗口或退出整个 App，请使用该 App 自己的关闭按钮。" = "RightScreen can still manage its position and size, but the window doesn’t provide a standard close button. To avoid closing the wrong window or quitting the whole app, use the app’s own close button.";
"无法关闭窗口" = "Can’t Close the Window";
"macOS 拒绝了这次关闭请求。请先切换到该窗口并处理其中的提示，然后重试。" = "macOS declined the close request. Switch to the window, handle any prompt in it, then try again.";
"无法开始布局" = "Can’t Start the Layout";
"RightScreen 未找到可用显示器。" = "RightScreen couldn’t find an available display.";
"没有可管理窗口" = "No Windows to Arrange";
"请先打开至少一个普通 App 窗口；最小化、全屏和不可缩放窗口会被跳过。" = "Open at least one regular app window first. Minimized, full-screen, and non-resizable windows are skipped.";
"好" = "OK";
"当前安装包身份不正确：%@\n\n请退出应用后执行：\nScripts/run-local.sh\n将应用重新安装到 /Applications/RightScreen.app。\n\n然后在“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 辅助功能”中删除旧的 RightScreen 条目，再重新勾选一次即可长期有效。" = "This installation has the wrong identity: %@\n\nQuit the app and run:\nScripts/run-local.sh\nto reinstall it to /Applications/RightScreen.app.\n\nThen remove the old RightScreen entry in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Accessibility and enable it again.";
"<空>" = "<empty>";
"Bundle ID 已变为 %@，预期为 %@。" = "The bundle ID changed to %@; expected %@.";
"无法读取当前进程的代码签名。" = "Can’t read the code signature of the running process.";
"无法读取当前 app 的静态代码签名。" = "Can’t read the app’s static code signature.";
"当前 app 的代码签名已损坏或与内容不匹配。" = "The app’s code signature is damaged or doesn’t match its contents.";
"无法读取当前 app 的签名证书信息。" = "Can’t read the app’s signing certificate.";
"当前 app 使用了临时 adhoc/linker-signed 签名。" = "The app uses a temporary ad hoc or linker signature.";
"辅助功能授权无法保持" = "Accessibility Permission Won’t Persist";
"RightScreen 正在运行，但 macOS 没有给它分配菜单栏槽位，图标被停在了看不见的位置。\n\n请打开“系统设置 → 菜单栏”，把 RightScreen 的开关关掉再打开；\n若仍不显示，请检查 Bartender、iBar 等菜单栏管理工具是否把它收进了隐藏区。" = "RightScreen is running, but macOS didn’t give it a slot in the menu bar, so its icon is out of sight.\n\nOpen System Settings → Menu Bar and turn RightScreen off and on again.\nIf it still doesn’t appear, check whether a menu bar manager such as Bartender or iBar has hidden it.";
